msgid "Current source organization"
msgstr "当前源码组织"

msgid ""
"Private IP sources now belong to the F4 package. SoC targets select and "
"compile those sources directly; source ownership adds no runtime dispatch "
"layer. Native models live under `tests/support/native/` and require explicit"
" `test_support=True`, CLI `--test-support` or `NEXUS_TEST_SUPPORT=ON` in "
"CMake. They are test support, not a second production SoC."
msgstr ""
"私有 IP 源码现归 F4 包所有。SoC 目标直接选择和编译这些源码；源码归属不会增加运行时分派层。Native 模型位于 "
"`tests/support/native/`，须显式使用 `test_support=True`、CLI `--test-support` 或 "
"CMake 的 `NEXUS_TEST_SUPPORT=ON`。它们是测试支持，不是第二个生产 SoC。"

msgid ""
"The [source map](source-map.md) links authoritative layer contracts. Board "
"and SoC directories contain no Python plugins. The default host generator "
"uses Python for validation and static connections. Core's handwritten C "
"platform coordinator owns startup, stop, rollback and diagnostics; F4's "
"private C coordinator owns System and shared-resource sequencing. There is "
"one maintained host configuration implementation; its code is not linked "
"into firmware."
msgstr ""
"[源码定位](source-map.md)链接各层权威合同。Board 和 SoC 目录不含 Python 插件。默认主机生成器使用 Python "
"校验配置并生成静态连接。Core 的手写 C 平台协调器负责启动、停止、回滚和诊断；F4 私有 C 协调器负责 System "
"和共享资源顺序。主机配置只维护一套实现，其代码不链接到固件。"

msgid ""
"All vendor sources, Gitlinks, locks and licenses remain available. Only "
"selected dependencies enter preparation, verification, compilation or Source"
" SDK output. An unused SDK is neither current platform support nor a "
"required F4 build input."
msgstr ""
"全部厂商源码、Gitlink、锁和许可证继续保留。只有所选依赖进入准备、验证、编译或 Source SDK 输出。未选用的 SDK "
"既不表示当前平台支持，也不是 F4 构建的必需输入。"

msgid "Optional network data and boot boundaries"
msgstr "可选网络数据与 boot 边界"

msgid ""
"Optional network targets keep copied RX and payload-loaned RX as distinct, "
"explicit stack profiles; one image selects one profile. The copied TCP byte "
"face copies accepted writes into bounded stack storage. A payload-loaned RX "
"frame instead has a copied writable prefix and immutable MAC-backed tails. "
"Final pbuf free marks release readiness; the serialized owner performs the "
"actual MAC release later. Outstanding references or failed release retain "
"storage and withdrawal responsibility. The {ref}`network composition "
"contract <lwip-loaned-rx-contract>` owns the exact public/Storage targets, "
"capacities and failure rules. These optional components fit FIG-01's "
"component boundary without adding a worker or runtime registry."
msgstr ""
"可选网络 target 将复制 RX 与负载借用 RX 保持为独立、显式选择的协议栈配置；每个镜像选择一种配置。复制 TCP "
"字节接口面将已接纳的写入复制到有界协议栈存储。负载借用 RX 帧则有复制的可写前缀和不可变的 MAC 原始负载尾段。最后一次 pbuf free "
"标记已可归还；串行 owner 随后实际归还 MAC 借用。尚存引用或归还失败时，存储与退出责任继续保留。{ref}`网络装配合同 <lwip-"
"loaned-rx-contract>`负责定义精确的公共／Storage target、容量和失败规则。这些可选组件符合 FIG-01 "
"的组件边界，不增加 worker 或运行时注册表。"

msgid ""
"MCUboot exposes distinct control and full-boot targets. The reference links "
"the application and bootloader as separate images. The generic C11 control "
"target requests or queries trailer state; an explicit concrete Flash port "
"uses caller-owned regions, a valid clock and one finite deadline for each "
"operation. Only the separate boot image selects verification and overwrite-"
"copy code. The [canonical MCUboot contract and ownership "
"diagram](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/mcuboot/README.md) own those dependencies and product "
"reset/recovery duties. The selected profile provides permanent overwrite "
"only; partial trailer writes leave product recovery responsibility and imply"
" no rollback. The {ref}`control API <mcuboot-control-contract>` neither "
"authenticates candidate bytes nor starts hardware. Source documentation, "
"software models and linked budgets do not establish new firmware-candidate "
"or physical HIL qualification."
msgstr ""
"MCUboot 提供独立的控制与完整 boot target；参考配置将应用与 bootloader 链接为两个独立镜像。通用 C11 控制 "
"target 请求或查询 trailer 状态；显式具体 Flash port 为每次 operation 使用调用方持有的 "
"region、有效时钟和一个有限 deadline。只有独立 boot 镜像选择校验与覆盖复制代码。[MCUboot "
"权威合同及所有权图](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/mcuboot/README.md)负责定义这些依赖，以及产品复位／恢复责任。所选配置仅提供永久覆盖；部分 "
"trailer 写入仍留下产品恢复责任，不代表有回滚。{ref}`控制 API <mcuboot-control-"
"contract>`不鉴别候选字节，也不启动硬件。源码文档、软件模型和链接预算不建立新的固件候选或物理 HIL 资格。"

