msgstr "`Nexus::Platform`"

msgid ""
"Exact SoC/Board facts, selected providers, static factory and explicit "
"lifecycle"
msgstr "精确 SoC／Board 事实、所选 provider、静态 factory 与显式生命周期"

msgid "Product sources, workers, budgets, storage regions and recovery"
msgstr "产品源码、执行任务、预算、存储区域与恢复"

msgid "`Nexus::Runtime`"
msgstr "`Nexus::Runtime`"

msgid "Core, Arch, public I/O faces and the explicitly selected OS adapter"
msgstr "Core、Arch、公共 I/O 接口面与显式选择的 OS adapter"

msgid ""
"Startup, vectors, memory/clock facts, Board wiring and concrete device "
"providers"
msgstr "启动、向量、内存／时钟事实、Board 接线及具体设备 provider"

msgid ""
"One build directory admits one resolved assembly. Use separate build "
"directories for different boards or CPU/security images; a product build "
"coordinator or CI matrix owns their orchestration. Runtime and Platform "
"reuse the same production mechanisms but are separate consumption modes."
msgstr ""
"一个构建目录只接纳一份解析后的装配。不同板卡或 CPU／安全域镜像使用独立构建目录，由产品构建协调器或 CI 矩阵编排。Runtime 与 "
"Platform 复用相同生产机制，但属于不同的消费模式。"

msgid ""
"The common OS boundary is the wait/wake port. Task, queue, join and storage "
"APIs remain backend-specific, including the real kernel control-block types."
" Products switching kernels must adapt that lifecycle explicitly; no "
"universal object pool or hidden scheduling task is supplied."
msgstr ""
"共同 OS 边界是等待／唤醒端口。任务、队列、join 和存储 API "
"仍为后端专用，包括真实内核控制块类型。产品切换内核时必须显式适配生命周期；平台不提供统一对象池或隐藏调度任务。"

msgid "Build-time decisions and runtime work"
msgstr "构建期决策与运行时工作"

msgid ""
"TOML schema 2 is the only authored platform input. The parser freezes user "
"intent as `AuthoredAssembly`; `resolve_ir()` combines it with reviewed "
"SoC/Board facts and validates modes, resources, clocks, IRQs, ABI, DMA "
"reachability and budgets. It returns `ConfigurationIR` directly. Named "
"frozen records hold each decision once; they do not expose a Mapping facade "
"or a duplicate `values` store. Hardware fact leaves and keyed indexes still "
"use immutable mappings, and local resolver validation drafts may use "
"dictionaries. These are explicit data boundaries, not a promise to assign a "
"separate nominal type to every JSON field."
msgstr ""
"TOML schema 2 是平台唯一的人工编写输入。解析器将用户意图冻结为 `AuthoredAssembly`；`resolve_ir()` "
"结合经审查的 SoC/Board 事实，校验模式、资源、时钟、IRQ、ABI、DMA 可达性与预算，并直接返回 "
"`ConfigurationIR`。具名冻结记录为每个决策只保存一份值，不暴露 Mapping 包装接口，也不保存重复的 "
"`values`。硬件事实叶数据和按键索引仍使用不可变 mapping，resolver 的局部校验草稿也可用字典。这些是明确的数据边界，不承诺为每个 "
"JSON 字段创建独立名义类型。"

msgid ""
"Firmware execution is C11 plus necessary architecture assembly. Python runs "
"on the host to validate inputs and generate static C/H; the MCU has no "
"Python interpreter. Hardware algorithms belong in C: register access, "
"admission, waits, resource acquisition, rollback, stop and recovery. "
"Generation connects immutable configuration, exact instances, factory "
"getters and fixed IRQ handlers. Constant addresses and thin typed call "
"sequences can remain generated without adding a runtime interpreter or "
"another dispatch layer."
msgstr ""
"固件执行使用 C11 和必要的架构汇编。Python 在主机上校验输入并生成静态 C/H；MCU 不包含 Python 解释器。硬件算法归 C "
"实现：寄存器访问、准入、等待、资源取得、回滚、停止和恢复。生成器连接不可变配置、精确实例、factory getter 和固定 IRQ "
"handler。常量地址与简短的类型化调用序列可以继续生成，不增加运行时解释器或另一层分派。"

msgid ""
"F4 C owners implement admission, acquired-resource receipts, withdrawal and "
"readback. The default generated plan connects fixed typed callbacks and "
"ordinals from the resolved controller order to "
"`nx_platform_lifecycle_start/stop`; the C engine owns the control flow and "
"retries only the retained prefix. The existing `nx_lifecycle_*` reversible-"
"resource engine remains a separate optional mechanism. Native support is "
"explicitly test-scoped. Actual generated factories, models and ARM images "
"each require validation; historical cross-family results do not qualify this"
" refactor."
msgstr ""
"F4 C owner 实现准入、已取得资源收条、撤回和回读。默认生成的 plan 将固定 typed callback 和 resolved "
"controller 顺序中的 ordinal 连接到 `nx_platform_lifecycle_start/stop`；C "
"引擎维护控制流，并只重试保留的前缀。既有 `nx_lifecycle_*` 可撤销资源引擎仍是独立可选机制。Native 明确限定为测试支撑。实际生成 "
"factory、模型和 ARM 镜像各自需要验证；历史跨系列结果不授予本次重构资格。"

msgid ""
"A cold receipt proves which resources this caller actually acquired. "
"Rejection with an empty receipt cannot stop or overwrite an existing owner. "
"Partial acquisition and failed restoration retain the original snapshot and "
"unfinished effects for retry; a public peripheral stop does not discard the "
"enclosing Platform lease. These checks run on the real C helpers in the "
"register models. Factory lookup and ordinary I/O retain their existing "
"direct typed paths."
msgstr ""
"冷态收据证明调用者实际取得了哪些资源。获取被拒绝且收据为空时，不能停止或覆盖已有 "
"owner。部分取得和恢复失败会保留原始快照及未完成的效果，供后续重试；公开外设接口的停止不会丢弃外层 Platform "
"租约。这些检查通过寄存器模型执行真实 C 辅助函数。Factory 查询与普通 I/O 继续使用现有直接类型化路径。"

msgid ""
"Generated static C and maintained C use the same firmware toolchain. Moving "
"an algorithm changes its maintenance and test ownership; it does not promise"
" a universal resource reduction. The recorded F407 I2C owner-guard "
"comparison saves RAM while increasing IRQ/DMA Flash. Linked costs and "
"physical timing retain their own source, configuration and measurement "
"requirements."
msgstr ""
"生成的静态 C 与维护中的 C 使用同一固件工具链。迁移算法改变的是维护和测试责任，并不保证所有配置的资源占用都下降。已记录的 F407 I2C "
"owner 防护对照节省 RAM，但增加 IRQ／DMA 的 Flash 占用。链接资源成本与物理时序各自保留源码、配置和测量要求。"

msgid ""
"![Actual compile-target dependency relationships](../assets/diagrams/build-"
"targets.svg)"
msgstr "![实际编译目标依赖关系](../assets/diagrams/build-targets.svg)"

msgid "Actual compile-target dependency relationships"
msgstr "实际编译目标依赖关系"

msgid ""
"FIG-02 is the checked compile graph. Vendor and provider includes remain "
"private; public consumers receive Nexus types and selected compile/link "
"policy."
msgstr "FIG-02 是已核对的编译图。厂商和提供者包含路径保持私有；公共消费工程获得 Nexus 类型及所选编译／链接策略。"

msgid ""
"![Authored inputs, atomic generation and firmware "
"artifacts](../assets/diagrams/configuration-generation.svg)"
msgstr "![编写的输入、原子生成与固件产物](../assets/diagrams/configuration-generation.svg)"

msgid "Authored inputs, atomic generation and firmware artifacts"
msgstr "编写的输入、原子生成与固件产物"

msgid ""
"FIG-03 shows current generation. Unknown and conflicting selections fail; no"
" Kconfig/cache/old-header fallback repairs them. Runtime factory lookup "
"returns an existing face. After explicit successful platform start, ordinary"
" operations call its shared ops table with its instance context. IRQ "
"dispatch is fixed to provider instances and does not repeat factory lookup "
"for every byte."
msgstr ""
"FIG-03 表达当前生成流程。未知或冲突选择必须失败；不得通过 "
"Kconfig／缓存／旧头文件回退修补。运行时类型化工厂查找返回已有接口面。平台显式启动成功后，普通操作通过共享 ops 表调用该实例上下文。IRQ "
"分发固定到提供者实例，不为每个字节重复执行工厂查找。"

msgid ""
"The explicit F4 descriptor is `tools/configure/stm32f4_descriptor.py`; the "
"centralized configuration adapter lives under `tools/configure/stm32f4/`. "
"Production family enumeration contains only F4; Native uses an explicit "
"test-support context. Descriptors identify inputs and selected code, without"
" becoming a second source graph."
msgstr ""
"显式 F4 descriptor 位于 `tools/configure/stm32f4_descriptor.py`，集中维护的配置适配器位于 "
"`tools/configure/stm32f4/`。生产系列枚举只有 F4；Native 使用显式测试支持上下文。Descriptor "
"标识输入和所选代码，不成为第二份源码图。"

msgid ""
"The constructor contract uses named immutable IR and direct calls for fixed "
"connections. Vendor types and mutable Handles stay private. Generated "
"definitions still require compiler, model and linked-image validation. The "
"selected F407 UART `dma-tx` transport combines finite official HAL TX and "
"disjoint LL IRQ RX under one owner. Other modes retain their explicit "
"implementations. See the [official driver contract](../design/official-"
"stm32-provider.md)."
msgstr ""
"构造合同使用不可变具名 IR 与直接调用建立固定连接。厂商类型及可变 Handle 保持私有。生成定义仍须经过编译器、模型与链接镜像验证。所选 F407"
" UART `dma-tx` transport 在同一所有者下组合有限官方 HAL TX 与职责不重叠的 LL IRQ "
"RX。其他模式保留各自明确实现。参阅[官方驱动合同](../design/official-stm32-provider.md)。"

msgid "Lifecycle and failure responsibility"
msgstr "生命周期与失败责任"

msgid ""
"![Current initialization, failure withdrawal and retained cleanup "
"responsibility](../assets/diagrams/platform-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr "![当前初始化、失败撤回与保留的清理责任](../assets/diagrams/platform-lifecycle.svg)"

msgid ""
"Current initialization, failure withdrawal and retained cleanup "
"responsibility"
msgstr "当前初始化、失败撤回与保留的清理责任"

msgid ""
"FIG-05 shows explicit startup and reverse cleanup. A static face can exist "
"before start and after stop; its pointer is not a capability to execute cold"
" hardware. Partial failure can retain irreversible watchdog effects or busy "
"borrows. Products must inspect primary and cleanup outcomes, continue the "
"real executor, and retain quarantined resources. Platform start never starts"
" a scheduler."
msgstr ""
"FIG-05 表达显式启动与逆序清理。静态接口面可以在启动前和停止后存在；其指针不授予操作未启动硬件的权限。部分失败可能留下不可逆 watchdog "
"效果或活跃借用。产品必须检查主要结果与清理结果，继续运行真实执行器，并保留隔离资源。平台启动从不启动调度器。"

msgid ""
"Physical Flash reports exact geometry and `program_flags`. An ECC fresh-"
"erase requirement belongs to the caller's provenance contract: all-FF "
"readback cannot prove unused ECC state, and a failed pulse requires another "
"erase. All-FF source units issue no pulse. A started pulse must settle "
"before return; an expired deadline prevents later pulses and never cancels "
"hardware already programming. Products own writable regions, voltage, "
"execution stalls, watchdog and power loss."
msgstr ""
"物理 Flash 报告精确 geometry 和 `program_flags`。ECC fresh-erase 是调用方的真实历史合同：全 FF "
"读回不能证明 ECC 未被编程，失败脉冲后必须重新擦除。全 FF 输入单元不产生脉冲。已启动的脉冲必须先排空才能返回；过期 deadline "
"只能阻止后续脉冲，不能取消正在编程的硬件。产品负责可写 region、电压、执行停顿、watchdog 与掉电策略。"

msgid ""
"Optional generated diagnosed start/stop entries write phase and controller "
"location to caller-owned cold-path storage. They retain no diagnostic "
"pointer and do not replace the primary/cleanup results or remaining-effect "
"obligations. See [the diagnostic contract](../design/official-"
"stm32-provider.md) for index meaning and failure responsibilities. The "
"{ref}`factory diagnostic mapping <factory-controller-diagnostics>` adds "
"named assembly-local ordinals and optional immutable labels; it does not "
"create a device-ready state machine or a second capability object."
msgstr ""
"可选生成的 diagnosed start/stop 入口把 phase 与 controller 位置写入调用者拥有的冷态存储。不保留 "
"diagnostic 指针，也不替代 primary/cleanup "
"结果或剩余影响责任。索引含义和失败责任见[诊断合同](../design/official-"
"stm32-provider.md)。{ref}`Factory 诊断映射 <factory-controller-"
"diagnostics>`增加装配局部具名序号和可选不可变标签，不建立 device-ready 状态机或第二个 capability 对象。"

msgid "Costs and tradeoffs"
msgstr "成本与取舍"

msgid ""
"A 32-bit face contains two pointers: eight bytes of readonly storage. "
"Provider/mode ops are shared; exact mutable state and selected buffers "
"remain separate. Indirection lets one public interface serve independent "
"concrete providers and GoogleMock ports. Its cost is one public dispatch and"
" code/readonly table retention; actual Flash/RAM and timing are measured on "
"the selected linked image."
msgstr ""
"32 位接口面包含两个指针，占用八字节只读存储。提供者／模式的 ops 共享；精确可变状态与所选缓冲区分开。间接调用允许同一公共接口服务独立具体提供者与"
" GoogleMock 端口。成本是一次公共分发以及保留代码／只读表；实际 Flash／RAM 与时序必须在所选链接镜像上测量。"

msgid ""
"Static assembly rejects conflicts early and prunes unselected drivers. It "
"deliberately forgoes hotplug discovery, runtime string registries, arbitrary"
" dynamic clock changes and automatic recovery policy. Optional shared owners"
" add explicitly budgeted slots and synchronization; direct single-executor "
"paths need no default OS lock or worker."
msgstr ""
"静态装配提前拒绝冲突，裁剪未选择驱动。它不提供热插拔发现、运行时字符串注册表、任意动态时钟变化或自动恢复策略。可选共享 owner "
"增加显式预算的槽与同步；直接单执行器路径不需要默认 OS 锁或执行任务。"

msgid ""
"Read [factory](factory.md), [ownership](ownership.md), the [integration "
"contract](../design/integration-contracts.md) and [exact "
"support](../reference/platforms/support.md). Architecture diagrams explain "
"mechanisms; tests, image checks and HIL establish their separate execution "
"scopes."
msgstr ""
"阅读[类型化工厂](factory.md)、[所有权](ownership.md)、[接入合同](../design/integration-"
"contracts.md)和[精确支持范围](../reference/platforms/support.md)。架构图解释机制；测试、镜像检查和 "
"HIL 分别建立各自执行范围。"

msgid "The production MCU tree contains one series package, `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`. The selected device, package and mode come from its reviewed catalogue; see [exact support](../delivery/support.md). F407 Board integration and the new internal-CRC software references have distinct evidence. A family directory or official HAL macro does not establish another part, mode or physical result."
msgstr "生产 MCU 树只有一个系列包 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`。所选器件、封装和模式来自已审目录，见[精确支持](../delivery/support.md)。F407 Board 接入与新增内部 CRC 软件参考分别取得证据。系列目录或官方 HAL 宏不建立其他料号、模式或物理结果。"

msgid "Factory and emitters consume the same typed result. `to_dict()` derives the schema-1 `resolved.json` audit/artifact projection; it is never read back as an authored platform input. Private typed source epoch 3 is separate from that serialized format and from the public C factory epoch. Old JSON assemblies are rejected. Historical evidence keeps its original bytes and read-only verification. CMake owns the source dependency graph; resolution does not discover software from device names or generate product workers."
msgstr "factory 和 emitter 消费同一份类型化结果。`to_dict()` 派生 schema-1 `resolved.json` 审计/产物投影；该输出从不回读为人工平台输入。私有 typed source epoch 3 与该序列化格式及公共 C factory epoch 分别独立。旧 JSON 装配会被拒绝；历史证据保留原始字节和只读验证。CMake 拥有软件依赖图；解析不根据设备名发现软件，也不生成产品 worker。"
